# What never gets uploaded to a build.
#
# This file REPLACES .gitignore for Vercel's purposes rather than adding to it,
# which is the trap: anything ignored there and not repeated here would start
# being uploaded. The secrets line is the one that matters — the deployment
# reads its variables from the project's own settings, never from a file that
# rode along with the source.

node_modules
.next
out
build

# Secrets. The whole reason this file is explicit.
.env
.env.local
.env*.local

.git
eval-reports
coverage
*.log
.DS_Store
